    <string name="data_collection_disclaimer_short">CEMO collects account details and scale telemetry (weight, temperature, humidity) to provide smart waste monitoring and analytics.</string>
    <string name="data_collection_full_text">1. Information We Collect\n• Account Information: Your name, email address, and profile details for identification and security.\n• Waste &amp; Sensor Telemetry: Sensed weight measurements, logging timestamps, ambient temperature, and humidity from connected CEMO devices.\n\n2. How We Use Your Data\n• To calculate real-time waste loads and environmental impact statistics.\n• To alert you when container thresholds are reached.\n• To synchronize historical records with your cloud account.\n\n3. Data Storage &amp; Privacy\n• Data is securely stored using Firebase Authentication and Firestore security rules.\n• We do not sell or distribute personal data or telemetry to third parties.\n\n4. Your Rights\n• You may view, edit, or delete logged waste records and update your profile at any time in the app.</string>
